---

<section id="agendamento" class="relative py-32 bg-amber-900 overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Grainy Overlay -->
    <div
        class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[url('https://grainy-gradients.vercel.app/noise.svg')] mix-blend-overlay pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/80"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 relative z-10 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-serif text-white mb-8">
            Pronto para elevar <br /> seu nível?
        </h2>
        <p
            class="text-zinc-300 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 font-light"
        >
            A agenda enche rápido. Garanta seu horário e vivencie a experiência
            Gentleman.
        </p>

        <div
            class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-6"
        >
            <a
                href="#booking-action"
                class="bg-amber-600 text-black px-12 py-5 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform text-lg"
            >
                Agendar Agora
            </a>
            <a
                href="https://wa.me/5511999999999"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="border border-white/20 text-white px-12 py-5 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors text-lg"
            >
                Contato WhatsApp
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
